        <body>
            <div xml:id="d659">

                <pb facs="0981" n="877" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg877"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">884.6461 Tsana Dam/434: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ethiopia (Southard) to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-08-19T11:00:00+02:35">August 19, 1933—11
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 20—7:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please inform White Engineering Corporation that I just now have possession of
                    the Egyptian check for $159,153 endorsed to them and will mail at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Southard</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
